# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Verify that the `XY4` sequence leaves the state unchanged up to a global phase.\n"
msgstr "`XY4` 시퀀스가 전역 위상(global phase)을 제외하고 상태를 변하지 않게 유지함을 확인하십시오.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
